      "line" : 23,
      "npc" : "MvP Ladder Warper",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[MvP Ladder Warper]\nIn this game, your party has to kill every single MvP monster in ascending order, from the weakest to strongest.",
      "translation" : "[MVP阶梯传送员]\n你的队伍要按从弱到强的顺序，击败所有MVP魔物。"
    },
